      "settings": {
        "heading": "Discount Branded Clothing & Footwear",
        "content": "<p>Introducing <strong>Brand Corner</strong>, your ultimate destination for affordable, discounted branded apparel and footwear online. Enjoy savings of up to 75% off the recommended retail price, featuring renowned names such as Bewley & Rich, Born Rich, CRS55, Crosshatch, Duck and Cover, Dunlop, EKO Essentials, Farah, French Connection, Juice, Money, NVME, Smith and Jones, and Von Dutch.</p><p><br/>At Brand Corner, we provide genuine, high-quality products at unbeatable discounts. Whether you're in search of jeans, jumpers, shirts, footwear, socks, boxers, accessories, or wardrobe essentials like trainers, t-shirts, and jackets, Brand Corner is your go-to destination for securing authentic, must-have items at a fraction of the cost.</p>",
